{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Vanessa Breaks up With Marco", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Apology", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 8, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 12, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " An Apology Letter", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">When you write an apology letter, you need to:</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">1. State why you are writing the letter.  </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: I am writing you this letter to apologize. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">2. Admit your mistake or inappropriate behavior.  </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say what you're apologizing for and why it was wrong. You need to be very specific and clear. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: I am sorry for yelling at you. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">3. Write about how much you hurt the other person. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Acknowledge that the person was hurt and that you understand how they may feel. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: I embarrassed you in public and that is unforgivable. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">4. Express your gratitude. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Show that you really do feel badly about what you did and that you value this person.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: You are an incredible person. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">5. Accept responsibility.  </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You need to admit that your mistake is your responsibility. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: What I did at the restaurant was wrong. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">6. State how you will make this a better relationship in the future. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Express that you would like to move forward and learn from past errors.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: I hope we can move forward from this and look towards the future.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Making and Responding To Promises", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the Future tense to make promises.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Often the moment the event will happen is unknown. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "This tense is often used with the following time expressions:<br /><br/>soon, next month, next week", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Positive</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Subject + will + verb + object(s) + time expression </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: I will be on my best behavior when we see your friends next week. </span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "insensitive", "type": "name"}, {"content": "showing that you do not know or care about the feelings of other people ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I apologize for my insensitive behavior.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use in an apology letter.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "immaturity", "type": "name"}, {"content": "acting in a childish way ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I showed a lot of immaturity.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "finer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "good, acceptable, or satisfactory ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It was not one of my finer moments.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ashamed ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling shame or guilt ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You were so ashamed of me.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "come to think of it ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "when I think back", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Come to think of it, I embarrassed you last week too.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "decent", "type": "name"}, {"content": "polite, moral, and honest ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm actually a pretty decent guy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "gratitude", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling of appreciation or thanks ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I wanted to express my gratitude.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{